      ],
      "en": "Behold, I have made you small among the nations. You are greatly despised.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 가라사대 내가 너를 열국 중에 미약하게 하였으므로 네가 크게 멸시를 받느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4f40ab154573e3836631896975d64bc44804f66373dc75674f63944c60c9e1fc",
      "translation_text_hash": "e6a9b618b03368c0a9befecdbd13ebc5bdc866cbf06c5d0d7391965278c859eb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
