      "en": "For the violence done to your brother Jacob, shame will cover you, and you will be cut off forever.",
      "ko": "네가 네 형제 야곱에게 행한 포학을 인하여 수욕을 입고 영원히 멸절되리라",
      "source_text_hash": "14c1e89749e1af5b462974fa9ae36ff263a8c6df174c62e874fe8a00ac2eb409",
      "translation_text_hash": "91ae68d49c1ee2fd3929dea116c0dc2b1368daf2e9676b7742c6d6b89d3b00c8",
