      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "OBA",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "For as you have drunk on my holy mountain, so all the nations will drink continually. Yes, they will drink, swallow down, and will be as though they had not been.",
      "ko": "너희가 내 성산에서 마신 것 같이 만국인이 항상 마시리니 곧 마시고 삼켜서 본래 없던 것 같이 되리라",
      "source_text_hash": "a1da9d7bbd20be2df7d6e11c325b287b4d39194c3af2b94d0506f287c1822f69",
      "translation_text_hash": "c4721823d29e9375e0c63001424f7dd2c5768cb629d606b44405ffeccb7196c7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
