      ],
      "en": "Saviors will go up on Mount Zion to judge the mountains of Esau, and the kingdom will be the LORD’s.",
      "ko": "구원자들이 시온산에 올라와서 에서의 산을 심판하리니 나라가 여호와께 속하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "07fea5aa40c27cc13f3dfd0ca01cbc597fa8064d4e496c5b73325a48c5a2f633",
      "translation_text_hash": "0fff461a8699972db660011479b6ff9cd3829ff46a8503df83fe6126ff354148",
